@startuml UC14_Receive_Warning_Notification_Activity_Diagram

title UC14: Receive Warning Notification - Activity Diagram

start
:System (UC17) triggers warning notification;
:System retrieves user notification preferences;
:System sends notification via configured channel
(email/SMS/push);

if (Notification delivered successfully?) then (yes)
  :User receives notification with warning details;
  if (User clicks notification link?) then (yes)
    :User views full forecast details;
  endif
  stop
else (no - delivery failed)
  :System retries using alternative channel;
  stop
endif

note right
  Multiple cities affected:
  System consolidates into
  single notification
end note

@enduml
